    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "Nothing at all was charted here. Of the forty regions the survey has walked this is the only one that carries not one landform on the sheet, and no road on Thirstwold comes onto it or onto either of the two regions it touches. Parties cross it for the floor under the sand: lag the wind has swept clean of everything finer, already sorted and already graded, and the biggest stones standing in that lag, which are picked up rather than dug."
